title: "AEROLAB X — Drone Design, Intelligence & Simulation Studio"
abstract: >-
  Open-source, browser-based engineering workstation for the conceptual design,
  analysis and documentation of civilian UAVs and micro aerial vehicles, with
  documented, tested models and explicit data provenance.
